NV_PK(22,{"add salt and a few drops of rice wine before serving":"","soak the herbs for an hour first and they will cook soft faster":"","clay pot duck":"","1 piece of dried mullet roe":"","1 piece of white radish":"","2 stalks of garlic greens":"","peel the thin skin off the mullet roe":"","wipe both sides with rice wine":"","grill each side for one minute until the surface bubbles":"","catch the ingredients for clay pot duck":"","3 tbsp fried shallots":"","2 liters of pork bone broth":"","fry the garlic and dried flatfish until they smell good":"","cook the cabbage in the bone broth until it is very soft":"","put the whole duck into the pot on top of the cabbage":"","add the garlic flatfish and fried shallots":"","stew over low heat for three hours":"","keep the heat low so the duck stays whole and the soup stays clear":"","grilled mullet roe":"","catch the ingredients for grilled mullet roe":"","slice the mullet roe radish and garlic greens thinly":"","serve each slice of roe on a slice of radish":"","don't grill it too long the inside should still be soft and a little sticky":"","clay pot duck is cooked for only ten minutes":"","the cabbage is cooked until it is very soft":"","a mei in tainan still cooks it over charcoal":"","four herb soup is made with four kinds of chinese herbs":"","four herb soup is a sweet dessert soup":"","people often eat it with gua bao or sticky rice":"","you need salt to make four herb soup":"","you need pumpkin to make four herb soup":"","you need duck to make clay pot duck":""});